      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ĩndĩ mũtũmwa athi, na avika na amwon’ya Ndaviti w’onthe ũla Yoavu wamũtũmĩe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na mũtũmwa amwĩa Ndaviti, Andũ nĩmatũkĩlilye vinya, na matũtindĩka kũvika weũnĩ, naitũ twamatũngĩthya o kũvika ũlikĩlonĩ mbingĩlonĩ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na aathi me ũvainĩ maatha athũkũmi maku; na amwe ma athũkũmi ma mũsumbĩ nĩ akw’ũ, na mũthũkũmi waku Ulia ũla Mũititi nake no mũkw’ũ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ĩndĩ Ndaviti amwĩa mũtũmwa, Ũũ nĩw’o wĩmwĩa Yoavu, Ũndũ ũũ ndũkakwĩw’ĩthye woo, nũndũ ũvyũ nũminaa ũmwe o ta ũla ũngĩ; ongeleela kaũ waku vinya mbee ĩ ndũanĩ, noimĩng’uthũla: naku mwĩkĩe vinya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
